  m_Name: WaveExplanation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TowerDefence.Battlefield::TowerDefence.Battlefield.TutorialDefinition
  Id: WaveExplanation
  Title: How waves work
  Pages:
  - Enemy waves approach the shared base by land, water, or air. Protect its health
    and survive increasingly difficult attacks.
  - Defeated enemies reward resources through the combat and wave systems. Use the
    time between attacks to build, upgrade, and repair.
